         person is contype="0" conaffinity="0": kinematic scenery that cannot
         touch or push the robot.  Leading along a safe route is therefore a
         property of the PLANNER and the CONTROLLER, graded by measured surface
         clearance, not by the contact solver.

         partition_c is sealed against the north wall and hall_screen against
         the south wall, so no inflated path can pass either of them on the
